  + artifact instance authorization or issuer identity collides with predecessor identities
  + signature valid for another upstream child artifact instance action policy nonce or sequence range is replayed
  + descriptor SHA256 is reported as physically recomputed file evidence
  + opaque Needle selector is reported as model availability compatibility license safety or testing
  + positive authorization is promoted to attempt completion loaded state provider call inference or launch
  + context memory thread or GPU ceilings exceed fixed bounds or are reported as resource fit
  + unresolved truths denial set authority lifecycle or zero effects are removed and all digests recomputed
  + unknown duplicate trailing oversized malformed or noncanonical forms survive

& [Controls]
  + replay exact NHC-02 semantics and bind its complete bundle digest
  + domain-separate descriptor authorization request and envelope digests and verify Ed25519 over the exact canonical payload
  + require identity separation exact states fifteen denials ten unresolved truths typed faults bounded strict forms deterministic replay and independent retained evidence
